sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor C as 调用方 fiber
    participant N as ProtocolNode
    participant P as PendingTable
    participant K as ICodec
    participant T as ITransport
    participant R as 读循环 fiber

    C->>N: Request(req, options)
    N->>N: AllocateSession() → session_id<br/>（SessionLease 接管，析构自动归还）
    N->>N: 盖章 frm_type/protocol_id/session_id
    N->>P: Register(request_key) → Handle
    N->>K: Encode(req) → bytes
    N->>T: Write(SendUnit) 帧进内核才成功
    Note over C,N: 背压经 await 传导；Write 成功后
    N->>P: Handle.Wait(options) 挂起
    Note over C: 调用方 fiber 在此挂起等待

    T-->>R: 对端回送响应字节到达
    R->>T: Read() → Datagram
    R->>K: Decode(bytes) → Message[]
    R->>N: DecodeAndDispatch → Dispatch(msg)
    N->>N: IsTerminal? kResponse/kResult → response_key
    N->>P: Resolve(key, msg)
    Note over P: Resolve / 超时 / 取消 / FailAll<br/>四方抢同一原子首胜 Complete
    P-->>C: 唤醒 Handle.Wait → Result~Message~
    N->>N: SessionLease 析构 → ReleaseSession
    N-->>C: return Result~Message~
